WEBVTT

00:01.810 --> 00:05.220
<i>It's almost time for the last game of the quarter-finals</i>

00:05.220 --> 00:07.650
<i>of the National Middle School Football Tournament.</i>

00:07.650 --> 00:08.730
HOKKAIDO REPRESENTATIVE
FURANO MIDDLE SCHOOL

00:08.140 --> 00:10.670
<i>Three teams have already made it to the best four,</i>

00:08.730 --> 00:09.940
TOKYO REPRESENTATIVE
TOHO ACADEMY

00:09.940 --> 00:11.110
SAITAMA PREFECTURE REPRESENTATIVE
MEIWA HIGASHI MIDDLE SCHOOL

00:10.670 --> 00:13.610
<i>with only this important match left to play.</i>

00:13.610 --> 00:20.660
<i>The fourth match of the quarter-finals will be held between Nankatsu MS from Shizuoka vs. Hirado MS from Nagasaki.</i>

00:20.660 --> 00:23.110
We've been waiting for this, Nankatsu!

00:23.110 --> 00:24.830
We're counting on you again, Tsubasa!

00:25.740 --> 00:27.650
So that's Nankatsu, the reigning champions.

00:27.650 --> 00:29.130
It's finally time.

00:29.130 --> 00:31.260
<i>It looks like Hirado will start the game.</i>

00:33.170 --> 00:34.890
<i>That's a calm smile.</i>

00:34.890 --> 00:39.310
<i>I'm almost certain that Hirado MS has a card up their sleeve that they haven't shown so far.</i>

00:39.310 --> 00:41.680
We'll go at it right away, y'know.

00:46.240 --> 00:48.950
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

00:46.240 --> 00:48.950
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

00:49.870 --> 00:52.540
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

00:49.870 --> 00:52.540
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

00:53.450 --> 00:56.170
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

00:53.450 --> 00:56.170
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

01:03.050 --> 01:05.880
<i>moeru you ni hitori demo</i>

01:03.050 --> 01:05.880
<i>I keep running, lying to myself</i>

01:05.880 --> 01:12.140
<i>ikiteyukeru to usobuite hashiritsudzukete</i>

01:05.880 --> 01:12.140
<i>that I can live alone, though the loneliness makes me burn</i>

01:12.140 --> 01:18.020
<i>unubore no morosa wo kimi wa shitteta no ni</i>

01:12.140 --> 01:18.020
<i>You knew how fragile my self-conceit makes me</i>

01:18.020 --> 01:24.610
<i>kokoro made uchinomaresareta kono yoru ni</i>

01:18.020 --> 01:24.610
<i>In this night that even shattered my heart</i>

01:24.610 --> 01:28.610
<i>kimi no koe sagasu</i>

01:24.610 --> 01:28.610
<i>I hate how weak I am</i>

01:28.610 --> 01:33.120
<i>kono yowasa ga nikui yo</i>

01:28.610 --> 01:33.120
<i>yearning for your voice</i>

01:33.120 --> 01:38.670
<i>ima sugu torimodoshi ni ikanakya</i>

01:33.120 --> 01:38.670
<i>"I've got to get you back right now!"</i>

01:38.670 --> 01:40.250
<i>baka darou?</i>

01:38.670 --> 01:40.250
<i>I'm stupid, right?</i>

01:40.250 --> 01:41.460
<i>ai</i>

01:40.250 --> 01:41.460
<i>Love!</i>

01:41.460 --> 01:44.960
<i>kizudarake no ai wo shinjite</i>

01:41.460 --> 01:44.960
<i>Believing in my scarred love</i>

01:44.960 --> 01:54.850
<i>nagareochita namida sae mo tsuyosa e to kaete</i>

01:44.960 --> 01:54.850
<i>I will turn these shedded tears into strength</i>

01:54.850 --> 01:55.680
<i>ai</i>

01:54.850 --> 01:55.680
<i>Love!</i>

01:55.680 --> 01:59.480
<i>kizudarake no ai da to shite mo</i>

01:55.680 --> 01:59.480
<i>Even though it is a scarred love</i>

01:59.480 --> 02:03.480
<i>bokura no sekai wo tomoshiteru</i>

01:59.480 --> 02:03.480
<i>it lightens up our world</i>

02:03.480 --> 02:09.740
<i>kono ai mo ichido taritomo</i>

02:03.480 --> 02:09.740
<i>I will not let go of this love</i>

02:09.740 --> 02:12.530
<i>hanasanai</i>

02:09.740 --> 02:12.530
<i>for a single moment!</i>

02:14.440 --> 02:19.450
<b><b>EPISODE 41:
THE FEARSOME DARK HORSE</b></b>

02:16.150 --> 02:20.610
<i>Nankatsu are last year's champions, and are aiming for their third victory.</i>

02:20.610 --> 02:23.410
<i>They are using their usual starting members today.</i>

02:23.410 --> 02:27.620
<i>Their opponents, Hirado, have won all of their matches so far, with 1-0 scores.</i>

02:27.620 --> 02:32.720
<i>Even though they haven't scored that much, Hirado are known for their strong defense.</i>

02:32.720 --> 02:37.050
<i>How will they handle the reigning champions Nankatsu, and their raging attack?</i>

02:37.050 --> 02:39.550
<i>Those are the keys to the match.</i>

02:39.550 --> 02:44.640
<i>With the last seat in the best four at stake, the game starts now!</i>

02:46.210 --> 02:50.140
<i>Right as the whistle blows, center forward Sano advances swiftly up the field.</i>

02:53.620 --> 02:57.490
<i>Hirado are building up and passing the ball around in their own side,</i>

02:57.490 --> 03:01.070
<i>carefully waiting for the time for the attack.</i>

03:01.070 --> 03:03.500
What's with that? So they won't come?

03:03.500 --> 03:05.620
Then we should just go to them!

03:06.220 --> 03:09.500
<i>Nankatsu's Taki quickly steals the ball!</i>

03:09.500 --> 03:11.020
All right!

03:13.330 --> 03:14.590
I'll pass through!

03:17.380 --> 03:18.090
Taki!

03:18.090 --> 03:23.930
<i>Taki tried to dribble past him, but he goes too fast and crashes right into Jito's giant body.</i>

03:23.930 --> 03:27.560
All right, I should show you Hirado's true power, y'know!

03:28.610 --> 03:31.090
Watch out, Morisaki! He's gonna shoot!

03:31.090 --> 03:31.600
Wha—

03:35.400 --> 03:36.520
Take this!

03:37.410 --> 03:38.920
<i>Jito surprises us!</i>

03:38.920 --> 03:42.740
<i>He fires away with a reckless long shot from the center circle!</i>

03:42.740 --> 03:43.660
What?!

03:43.660 --> 03:46.030
<i>That kick is really powerful.</i>

03:46.030 --> 03:48.910
<i>The ball rockets closer to Nankatsu's goal.</i>

03:48.910 --> 03:49.910
Morisaki!

03:49.910 --> 03:51.910
Okay, I can get this one!

03:54.580 --> 03:55.210
What?!

03:56.210 --> 03:59.300
<i>It's in... Goal!</i>

04:01.050 --> 04:06.470
<i>Sano jumped in from the side in front of the goal, and diverted Jito's shot, scoring a goal!</i>

04:06.470 --> 04:09.180
<i>Hirado scores the first goal in the blink of an eye!</i>

04:09.180 --> 04:14.520
<i>In this tournament, Hirado are considered the second dark horse right after Minamiuwa.</i>

04:18.070 --> 04:20.870
This is me and Sano's combination play, y'know!

04:20.870 --> 04:26.110
Even Nankatsu, the reigning champions, completely fell for such a cheap trick.

04:27.850 --> 04:29.760
Damn it...

04:29.760 --> 04:31.910
The game has just begun.

04:31.910 --> 04:34.660
If they take one from us, we should take one back.

04:34.660 --> 04:36.250
Tsubasa!

04:36.250 --> 04:38.250
It was just a lucky hit!

04:38.250 --> 04:39.520
Don't mind it!

04:39.520 --> 04:42.470
You can catch up to such a team in no time!

04:43.790 --> 04:45.470
Let's get back in the mood and go!

04:45.470 --> 04:46.770
Tsubasa's right!

04:46.770 --> 04:48.680
If they score, we score back right away!

04:49.500 --> 04:52.680
I, the Great Jito, won't let you score even a single goal!

04:54.190 --> 04:55.350
Watch out, Kisugi!

04:56.300 --> 04:58.600
<i>What incredible power!</i>

04:58.600 --> 05:04.150
<i>Jito blows away Kisugi with a high-power tackle and steals the ball!</i>

05:04.150 --> 05:07.520
<i>However, Tsubasa is here to pick up the loose ball.</i>

05:07.520 --> 05:09.580
All right. Let's score that tying goal first!

05:13.200 --> 05:15.330
<i>Noda closes in from the front line.</i>

05:18.290 --> 05:19.380
Now!

05:19.380 --> 05:23.090
Have a taste of my power defense!

05:25.010 --> 05:26.760
Tsubasa!

05:26.760 --> 05:29.600
That's bad! If your shoulder is hit that hard...

05:30.600 --> 05:33.770
<i>Jito gets the ball and keeps advancing.</i>

05:33.770 --> 05:36.820
<i>His violent dash makes him look like a speeding eighteen-wheeler.</i>

05:36.820 --> 05:38.520
I'm coming for the second goal, y'know!

05:38.520 --> 05:39.650
Damn you!

05:39.650 --> 05:42.070
Your little tricks won't work on me, y'know!

05:43.480 --> 05:48.070
<i>He's blown away, as if he was a small car colliding against that same speeding eighteen-wheeler!</i>

05:48.070 --> 05:50.780
It's absurd how sliding tackles don't even faze him...!

05:50.780 --> 05:54.160
His destructive power is even stronger than Hyuga's straight dribbling.

05:54.500 --> 05:56.330
Jito...

05:56.330 --> 05:57.950
It doesn't matter how many of us it takes!

05:57.950 --> 05:59.080
Hurry up and stop him!

05:59.080 --> 06:02.920
Well, before that, let me shoot, y'know!

06:04.460 --> 06:09.720
<i>Jito takes another long shot from around the center circle area!</i>

06:11.050 --> 06:14.160
Did you think we'd fall for the same trick again?!

06:14.160 --> 06:16.600
Don't take us for fools!

06:16.600 --> 06:21.060
<i>Nankatsu's gutsy Ishizaki takes the shot
right to the face and blocks it!</i>

06:21.060 --> 06:22.980
Nice, Ishizaki!

06:26.880 --> 06:29.730
Looks like our captain is slowly getting serious.

06:29.730 --> 06:32.240
Maybe I should get serious too.

06:32.660 --> 06:35.240
What are you going on about "<i>getting serious</i>", you bastard?!

06:37.790 --> 06:39.320
Cover for Ishizaki!

06:39.320 --> 06:40.170
Okay!

06:43.290 --> 06:44.380
<i>But he...</i>

06:44.500 --> 06:47.170
<i>Even 3 players can't stop him!</i>

06:48.920 --> 06:50.760
Everyone, Jito is coming!

06:52.940 --> 06:54.680
Should you really be looking away?

06:56.060 --> 06:57.810
This is bad! Don't let him shoot!

06:59.610 --> 07:00.690
What?!

07:00.690 --> 07:02.940
<i>Sano draws the defense away and passes!</i>

07:02.940 --> 07:06.480
<i>Yet, Nankatsu haven't left Jito completely unmarked.</i>

07:07.380 --> 07:08.960
Don't you get it?

07:08.960 --> 07:11.240
No matter how much little runts like you follow me,

07:12.320 --> 07:13.700
it's useless...

07:13.700 --> 07:14.950
...y'know!

07:16.650 --> 07:20.330
<i>Jito ignores his marker and takes a powerful shot!</i>

07:21.750 --> 07:24.590
<i>This time, it's a power shot from a short distance!</i>

07:25.920 --> 07:29.890
<i>He's got it! Morisaki uses his entire body to firmly catch the ball!</i>

07:29.890 --> 07:31.340
Well done, Morisaki!

07:38.580 --> 07:42.810
<i>What was that?! The goalkeeper was sent flying right into the goal!</i>

07:42.810 --> 07:44.130
What?!

07:44.130 --> 07:45.060
Morisaki!

07:45.060 --> 07:47.480
<i>What incredible strength!</i>

07:47.480 --> 07:49.730
<i>What incredible destructive power!</i>

07:49.730 --> 07:53.990
<i>Hirado scores another goal
thanks to their captain Jito's strong shot.</i>

07:55.220 --> 07:58.700
<i>Despite it being their first tournament appearance, Hirado is leading</i>

07:58.700 --> 08:01.830
<i>the famous reigning champions, Nankatsu by two goals!</i>

08:01.830 --> 08:08.460
<i>Nankatsu is in a state of emergency, having never fallen two goals behind, ever since the prelims.</i>

08:08.460 --> 08:12.260
<i>Is this a yellow light on their path to their third consecutive victory?</i>

08:12.260 --> 08:14.670
This second goal was a hard blow.

08:14.670 --> 08:15.260
Wha—

08:16.150 --> 08:19.370
<i>Hirado's second goal came from Jito and Sano's surprising combo play,</i>

08:19.370 --> 08:22.810
<i>an until-now hidden style that fuses power and finesse together.</i>

08:22.810 --> 08:28.570
<i>Between them, their captain Jito in particular has shown
a destructive power that far surpasses any middle schooler's,</i>

08:28.570 --> 08:33.400
<i>and he has demonstrated it to great effect against their opponents, the reigning champions Nankatsu.</i>

08:33.400 --> 08:38.490
<i>Hirado is a dark horse in the truest sense of the word! They've been hiding their dreadful fangs.</i>

08:38.490 --> 08:40.060
Did you see that, Nankatsu?

08:40.060 --> 08:42.000
This is Hirado's true power!

08:42.000 --> 08:45.040
Hirado is what you'd call a giant killer.

08:45.040 --> 08:46.070
What...?

08:46.070 --> 08:49.090
They were like this in Kyushu, during the Nagasaki prelims.

08:49.740 --> 08:57.640
Hirado was the one to beat Saikai MS, who were the overwhelming favorites, by a score of 6-0 in the final.

08:57.640 --> 09:04.640
Hirado have been taking it easy until now, waiting to reveal their amazing power just for this match.

09:04.690 --> 09:09.940
So, Hirado winning all of their games so far by 1-0 means...

09:09.940 --> 09:14.960
It means that, for them, none of their opponents were worth showing their true power against.

09:15.700 --> 09:20.320
The higher their opponent's level is, the stronger Hirado MS gets.

09:20.320 --> 09:26.700
And as his opponents get stronger and stronger, Hiroshi Jito gets all the more fired up.

09:26.700 --> 09:29.070
Come on now, Nankatsu.

09:29.070 --> 09:32.770
It won't be any fun whatsoever if this game ends like this.

09:32.770 --> 09:33.630
What?

09:33.630 --> 09:36.930
If you don't show even a little bit of backbone,

09:36.930 --> 09:41.200
then I won't have anything to show for my trip all the way here from Kyushu, y'know?

09:44.200 --> 09:46.770
Damn it. Just you watch, Jito!

09:55.740 --> 10:01.490
<i>Hirado MS took off the mysterious veil they had that was hiding their frightening power.</i>

10:01.490 --> 10:05.290
<i>Currently, the reigning champions Nankatsu are aiming to close this two goal gap.</i>

10:05.290 --> 10:07.290
Cheering is most important when you're behind!

10:07.290 --> 10:09.250
Guys, make it loud!

10:09.250 --> 10:10.130
Yeah!

10:10.130 --> 10:12.170
Don't get disheartened Nankatsu!

10:12.170 --> 10:14.960
You guys can't be the ones to lose here!

10:14.960 --> 10:16.670
<i>That's right.</i>

10:16.670 --> 10:17.970
<i>How could we...</i>

10:18.630 --> 10:20.760
<i>How could we afford to lose here?!</i>

10:22.220 --> 10:23.560
Let's go guys!

10:23.560 --> 10:24.390
Sure!

10:24.390 --> 10:28.730
<i>Oh, Hirado MS are crowding the center of the field and have tightened their defense!</i>

10:28.730 --> 10:30.860
So they'll really focus on their defense...

10:30.860 --> 10:31.730
Huh?

10:31.730 --> 10:35.940
Hirado have shut their opponents out,
allowing zero goals in this tournament.

10:35.940 --> 10:39.320
That shows how confident they are in their defense.

10:39.320 --> 10:43.030
That's what I meant when I said that a 2 goal lead was a huge blow.

10:43.030 --> 10:44.990
All right, we are going for it!

10:45.790 --> 10:49.120
<i>At Nankatsu's sides, Taki and Kisugi's movements are a bit dull.</i>

10:49.120 --> 10:52.840
<i>Are they a bit roughed up from their encounters with Jito?</i>

10:52.840 --> 10:54.420
Kisugi! Taki!

10:55.500 --> 10:57.170
<i>My shoulder is injured too!</i>

10:57.170 --> 10:58.420
<i>That's it.</i>

10:58.420 --> 11:01.180
Go! Crush Tsubasa!

11:01.180 --> 11:02.180
Yeah!

11:04.510 --> 11:05.350
Damn!

11:05.970 --> 11:08.270
<i>Tsubasa dodges by!</i>

11:08.270 --> 11:08.850
Izawa!

11:09.730 --> 11:10.270
Take it!

11:10.270 --> 11:11.310
<i>It connects!</i>

11:11.310 --> 11:14.400
<i>A beautiful one-two pass between Tsubasa and Izawa.</i>

11:14.400 --> 11:15.900
Izawa, go in front of the goal!

11:15.900 --> 11:16.730
Sure!

11:16.730 --> 11:20.570
<i>Tsubasa dribbles up the sideline, which is rare for him.</i>

11:20.570 --> 11:23.320
Hatayama, I am counting on you for #8.

11:23.320 --> 11:25.160
I will mark the other guy, y'know.

11:25.160 --> 11:25.910
Sure thing.

11:27.120 --> 11:28.250
Here it goes!

11:28.250 --> 11:30.580
<i>Tsubasa sends a cross in front of the goal!</i>

11:30.580 --> 11:34.170
<i>Is he sending the ball to Izawa, who is well-known for his prowess with headers?</i>

11:35.420 --> 11:36.420
What?!

11:36.420 --> 11:37.000
All right!

11:37.880 --> 11:39.920
<i>Izawa was a decoy!</i>

11:39.920 --> 11:42.840
<i>It's a superb cross aimed for Nagano!</i>

11:42.840 --> 11:43.840
Okay, I got it!

11:43.840 --> 11:45.350
I won't let you, y'know!

11:45.350 --> 11:48.720
<i>But Jito was on Nagano.</i>

11:48.720 --> 11:50.600
<i>Nankatsu couldn't score!</i>

11:50.600 --> 11:52.810
<i>Takeno picks up the loose ball.</i>

11:52.810 --> 11:54.480
<i>He sends a long pass to the front!</i>

11:54.980 --> 11:57.190
<i>It reaches Sano!</i>

11:57.820 --> 11:59.320
Guys, please, stop him!

11:59.320 --> 12:01.450
Leave it to me!

12:06.530 --> 12:11.460
We, Nankatsu defenders are not the sort of people you can beat with the same thing over and over again!

12:11.460 --> 12:12.830
Nice one, Takasugi!

12:12.830 --> 12:15.670
<i>Nankatsu are refusing to give up any more goals!</i>

12:15.670 --> 12:17.340
<i>Takasugi continues to advance.</i>

12:17.340 --> 12:19.840
<i>But Jito is coming to meet him!</i>

12:19.840 --> 12:21.010
Here I come, Jito!

12:21.010 --> 12:22.550
I won't lose in a contest of power!

12:24.430 --> 12:27.350
<i>It's a clash between two rivaling giants!</i>

12:33.390 --> 12:38.150
<i>Nankatsu can't get past Jito, even with Takasugi's power!</i>

12:39.530 --> 12:40.570
What?!

12:40.570 --> 12:44.150
<i>Oh, Jito's lost the ball for the first time this match.</i>

12:44.150 --> 12:47.700
They stole the ball from Captain.

12:47.700 --> 12:48.160
Heh.

12:48.740 --> 12:51.370
Well, it wouldn't be interesting otherwise, y'know.

12:53.410 --> 12:56.040
<i>Tsubasa is working hard despite his injured shoulder.</i>

12:56.040 --> 12:57.630
<i>We can do this much, at least!</i>

12:57.630 --> 13:00.000
Send it here, Tsubasa!

13:00.000 --> 13:02.260
Send that to us!

13:03.340 --> 13:05.380
Okay, counting on you!

13:06.510 --> 13:07.430
Let's go!

13:08.600 --> 13:10.060
Kisugi!

13:12.680 --> 13:14.730
<i>Kisugi fails to trap the ball.</i>

13:14.730 --> 13:17.650
<i>Hirado easily manages to recover the ball.</i>

13:17.650 --> 13:23.820
I will pay you guys back in Kisugi and Taki's stead, as Mamoru Izawa of the Shutetsu Trio!

13:24.900 --> 13:26.950
<i>Izawa steals the ball back!</i>

13:26.950 --> 13:29.160
<i>The game keeps shifting between offense and defense.</i>

13:29.160 --> 13:31.080
Like we'd let you go any further!

13:32.330 --> 13:33.160
Damn!

13:33.160 --> 13:35.290
<i>The ball's knocked loose from Izawa.</i>

13:35.290 --> 13:38.000
<i>Tsubasa quickly recovers it.</i>

13:38.000 --> 13:39.920
<i>Okay, here is the first goal!</i>

13:39.920 --> 13:42.550
I won't concede even a single goal!

13:44.050 --> 13:47.510
<i>Tsubasa's shot is right on time!</i>

13:52.810 --> 13:55.520
<i>His shot hits the post!</i>

13:55.520 --> 13:56.520
What?!

13:57.640 --> 13:58.440
<i>How unfortunate!</i>

13:58.440 --> 14:00.230
<i>Nankatsu couldn't score.</i>

14:00.230 --> 14:05.650
<i>Moreover, it seems Tsubasa's injured left shoulder was hit hard.</i>

14:05.650 --> 14:08.200
Tsubasa!

14:08.200 --> 14:12.790
<i>The moment you shot the ball, you tried to cover your shoulder from Jito's charge.</i>

14:12.790 --> 14:16.290
<i>Because of that, even though it was a slight change, your shot veered away.</i>

14:17.330 --> 14:18.670
Here, sending it!

14:18.670 --> 14:21.420
<i>Hirado begins their counter-attack.</i>

14:21.420 --> 14:23.050
Guys, get back quickly!

14:24.130 --> 14:25.380
Tsubasa!

14:25.380 --> 14:28.180
<i>Tsubasa is on the ground in pain and unable to stand.</i>

14:28.180 --> 14:30.840
<i>Hirado takes advantage and fiercely attacks!</i>

14:30.840 --> 14:33.890
Kisugi, we'll make up for our mistakes by defending hard!

14:33.890 --> 14:34.850
Yeah!

14:34.850 --> 14:39.980
<i>The two forwards Taki and Kisugi are desperately chasing Hirado down to fend their attack off.</i>

14:39.980 --> 14:44.530
<i>Meanwhile, Sano's picked up two markers, Nakazato and Ishizaki.</i>

14:46.990 --> 14:50.820
<i>Hirado stop in the center of the field and look for an opening.</i>

14:51.240 --> 14:52.620
Damn it!

14:52.620 --> 14:53.740
Tsubasa.

14:53.740 --> 14:54.950
Tsubasa...

14:54.950 --> 14:56.370
Tsubasa!

14:56.370 --> 15:01.080
<i>Both teams are caught in a stalemate with 5 minutes left in the first half.</i>

15:01.670 --> 15:04.460
I guess it's about time for me to deliver the killing blow.

15:04.460 --> 15:06.420
Send it to me, y'know!

15:06.420 --> 15:07.260
Jito!

15:09.340 --> 15:12.090
They will go with a combination play again!

15:12.090 --> 15:14.510
Don't let Sano ever get free!

15:14.510 --> 15:15.600
Sure!

15:18.020 --> 15:20.980
Sorry, but with this, it will be the third one in the first half!

15:20.980 --> 15:27.570
The legend of Nankatsu, the reigning champions, will be crushed by me, the great Hiroshi Jito—y'know!

15:30.320 --> 15:34.580
<i>I wonder if he failed to hit the ball properly? The ball does not have it's usual force.</i>

15:36.370 --> 15:37.740
That spin is...

15:37.740 --> 15:41.500
<i>Goalkeeper Morisaki comes out to catch the ball after its first bounce!</i>

15:41.500 --> 15:42.960
That's it!

15:45.290 --> 15:49.590
<i>Jito apparently added plenty of backspin to that ball!</i>

15:49.590 --> 15:50.510
What?!

15:54.430 --> 16:01.390
<i>Sano's volley shot synchronized with Jito's backspin pass has brought a third goal to Hirado!</i>

16:02.310 --> 16:09.400
<i>Nankatsu, the reigning champions, have quickly been put behind by three in the first half!</i>

16:09.400 --> 16:10.150
You guys did it!

16:10.150 --> 16:11.400
Jito! Sano!

16:11.400 --> 16:13.160
We got this match!

16:14.660 --> 16:15.910
Nankatsu is...

16:15.910 --> 16:17.410
Tsubasa is...

16:17.410 --> 16:18.330
...going to lose?

16:22.960 --> 16:25.830
<i>This was a really huge blow for them.</i>

16:25.830 --> 16:31.470
<i>Was this the goal that crushes their road to a V3, ending their legendary run full of injuries?</i>

16:32.840 --> 16:36.260
I guess that's all there is to football after all.

16:36.800 --> 16:39.180
That's too boring, y'know.

16:41.310 --> 16:43.730
It's no use.

16:43.730 --> 16:44.940
I can't win.

16:47.190 --> 16:51.400
<i>Wakabayashi, our V3 looks like an impossible task now.</i>

16:52.360 --> 16:55.610
<i>Misaki, if only you were here...</i>

16:56.910 --> 16:58.950
<i>Sorry, Roberto.</i>

16:58.950 --> 17:01.200
<i>I guess I'll lose after all. </i>

17:04.210 --> 17:05.750
Tsubasa?

17:06.330 --> 17:07.460
Tsubasa!

17:07.460 --> 17:09.170
What's wrong, Tsubasa?!

17:09.170 --> 17:10.340
Tsubasa!

17:11.460 --> 17:14.470
Tsubasa...!

17:16.840 --> 17:18.510
<i>What's with you, Tsubasa?</i>

17:25.890 --> 17:28.520
<i>Since when are you this much of a wimp?</i>

17:28.520 --> 17:31.320
<i>It might be a three goal lead, but it's only the first half.</i>

17:31.320 --> 17:33.650
<i>Are you going to give up on a match this early?</i>

17:33.650 --> 17:35.950
<i>He is right, Tsubasa.</i>

17:35.950 --> 17:38.700
<i>You can combine your play with any of your teammates'.</i>

17:38.700 --> 17:41.740
<i>Isn't that the united strength of Nankatsu?</i>

17:41.740 --> 17:45.660
<i>And yet, you were gonna give up here all by yourself, Tsubasa?</i>

17:45.660 --> 17:47.790
<i>Misaki...</i>

17:47.790 --> 17:49.710
<i>Wakabayashi...</i>

17:49.710 --> 17:51.670
<i>Tsubasa, don't give up!</i>

17:52.380 --> 17:53.920
<i>Use the Drive Shot.</i>

17:53.920 --> 17:55.670
<i>You have that.</i>

17:55.670 --> 18:01.680
<i>That dream-like, miraculous Drive Shot I left behind for you and taught you.</i>

18:01.680 --> 18:03.850
<i>Roberto...</i>

18:03.850 --> 18:05.480
<i>The Drive Shot...</i>

18:12.770 --> 18:13.730
Tsubasa!

18:13.730 --> 18:15.190
Get a hold of yourself, Tsubasa!

18:15.190 --> 18:17.990
Tsubasa!

18:17.990 --> 18:19.450
Hey, are you all right?

18:19.450 --> 18:20.410
The stretcher.

18:20.410 --> 18:21.740
Get the stretcher, quick!

18:21.740 --> 18:23.410
It's okay.

18:23.410 --> 18:25.950
I'm fine.

18:26.660 --> 18:28.460
Tsubasa...

18:28.460 --> 18:30.630
Are you really okay?

18:30.630 --> 18:31.460
Yeah.

18:31.460 --> 18:34.420
Hah, the result of this match is already decided, y'know.

18:34.420 --> 18:36.760
Why don't you just go back to sleep, y'know?

18:36.760 --> 18:38.680
What...?!

18:43.220 --> 18:45.680
<i>The first half ends here!</i>

18:45.680 --> 18:49.690
<i>Nankatsu are behind by a large margin of three goals.</i>

18:49.690 --> 18:54.610
<i>Nankatsu's third consecutive championship win is definitely in peril.</i>

18:54.610 --> 18:57.150
<i>They are in a truly desperate situation.</i>

18:57.150 --> 18:59.400
HIRADO MIDDLE SCHOOL
NAGASAKI PREFECTURE

18:58.360 --> 18:59.400
We did it guys!

18:59.910 --> 19:00.990
That's awesome!

19:00.990 --> 19:03.450
We have the lead, up three goals against Nankatsu.

19:03.450 --> 19:06.370
If we keep this up, we can score even more goals!

19:06.370 --> 19:09.160
We're counting on you guys in the second half too, Jito, Sano.

19:09.160 --> 19:10.420
It's enough.

19:10.420 --> 19:14.500
We will go for a 0-0 in the second half, preparing ourselves for tomorrow, y'know.

19:14.500 --> 19:15.300
Huh?

19:22.840 --> 19:24.100
<i>Captain.</i>

19:24.100 --> 19:25.720
<i>Is it you, Sano?</i>

19:25.720 --> 19:28.310
<i>Teacher was complaining about you.</i>

19:28.310 --> 19:33.360
<i>Saying that if you only took things seriously, we'd be so strong that no one would recognize us at first.</i>

19:33.360 --> 19:37.280
<i>Hah! They foisted the title of Captain on me, y'know.</i>

19:37.280 --> 19:40.650
<i>I wasn't really interested in football to begin with anyway.</i>

19:40.650 --> 19:43.570
<i>Is that why you skipped school and got into a fight?</i>

19:43.570 --> 19:44.990
<i>That's how it is.</i>

19:45.870 --> 19:50.410
<i>High schoolers these days are so spineless, it's boring, y'know.</i>

19:50.410 --> 19:53.830
<i>I wonder if there are stronger guys somewhere.</i>

19:53.830 --> 19:54.880
<i>There's one.</i>

19:54.880 --> 19:55.500
<i>Hmm?</i>

19:56.090 --> 19:58.460
<i>The strongest fellow is him now.</i>

19:58.960 --> 20:03.140
<i>This is the Nankatsu's captain, who took his team to two consecutive National Tournament championships.</i>

20:03.140 --> 20:05.470
<i>Well, it's in football rather than brawling, though.</i>

20:05.470 --> 20:08.810
<i>Sano, is this guy really that strong?!</i>

20:08.810 --> 20:15.770
<i>Yeah, football club members all over the country aim to defeat this Tsubasa Ozora.</i>

20:15.770 --> 20:17.230
<i>Now now.</i>

20:22.570 --> 20:25.160
<i>Practicing is so bothersome.</i>

20:25.160 --> 20:25.410
<i>Huh?</i>

20:26.070 --> 20:30.790
<i>However, defeating the strong is my hobby, y'know.</i>

20:30.790 --> 20:32.290
<i>Shall we give it a shot?</i>

20:32.830 --> 20:34.000
<i>Captain...</i>

20:35.290 --> 20:36.670
<i>Sure!</i>

20:37.790 --> 20:44.930
<i>The first opponent I got serious against was Nankatsu, and Tsubasa Ozora.</i>

20:44.930 --> 20:48.220
<i>To think it would be so easy to defeat them...</i>

20:49.430 --> 20:53.890
<i>I guess there is no one stronger than me after all.</i>

20:51.730 --> 20:54.730
INFIRMARY

20:54.730 --> 20:56.310
A three goal lead, eh?

20:56.310 --> 20:58.270
That's a lot of trouble for you.

20:58.270 --> 21:00.690
I guess even someone like you would think about giving up.

21:00.690 --> 21:01.650
No.

21:01.650 --> 21:04.530
I have the ability to make combinations with anyone,

21:04.530 --> 21:10.410
and most importantly, I have the Drive Shot, which I haven't even used once this match.

21:10.410 --> 21:13.910
I will definitely not give up!

21:15.290 --> 21:17.290
Tsubasa.

21:17.290 --> 21:20.210
Taki and Kisugi, are you two okay?

21:20.210 --> 21:22.420
We've just got some bruises.

21:22.420 --> 21:24.300
But Tsubasa...

21:26.890 --> 21:28.720
Tsubasa!

21:28.720 --> 21:30.220
Now then, let's go guys.

21:30.680 --> 21:31.810
It's time for the second half!

21:32.350 --> 21:33.680
Tsubasa!

21:33.680 --> 21:34.810
Yeah!

21:34.810 --> 21:37.440
That's right, we gotta do what we can anyway!

21:37.440 --> 21:40.020
We can't do anything about those three goals anymore.

21:40.020 --> 21:41.820
All right guys, let's do it!

21:41.820 --> 21:45.570
<i>One smile from him and everyone's got their eagerness back.</i>

21:45.570 --> 21:49.320
<i>I guess we've no choice but to rely on Tsubasa, injured or not.</i>

21:50.620 --> 21:53.120
<i>The second half is about to start.</i>

21:53.120 --> 21:56.540
<i>Nankatsu's Captain Tsubasa, whose health was a concern,</i>

21:56.540 --> 21:58.500
<i>is also on the pitch, ready to start the half.</i>

21:58.920 --> 22:00.290
Oh boy.

22:00.290 --> 22:03.210
Izawa, give the ball to me quickly.

22:03.210 --> 22:04.130
Huh?

22:04.130 --> 22:06.970
I will score a goal right away.

22:10.180 --> 22:12.060
<i>Here I come, Hirado.</i>

22:12.060 --> 22:18.520
<i>You guys will be the first one to have a taste of my Drive Shot!</i>

22:38.830 --> 22:44.880
<i>chotto are mi na ace ga tooru</i>

22:38.830 --> 22:44.880
<i>Hey, look over there at the ace passing through</i>

22:44.880 --> 22:50.890
<i>suguremono zo to machijû sawagu</i>

22:44.880 --> 22:50.890
<i>He's the best, and the whole town cheers him on</i>

22:50.890 --> 22:56.930
<i>chô-chô samba, zigzag samba</i>

22:50.890 --> 22:56.930
<i>Butterfly samba, zig-zag samba</i>

22:56.930 --> 23:01.560
<i>aitsu no uwasa de chamba mo hashiru</i>

22:56.930 --> 23:01.560
<i>Even little old ladies go around talking about him</i>

23:03.190 --> 23:07.860
<i>sore ni tsukete mo ore-tacha nan na no</i>

23:03.190 --> 23:07.860
<i>So, even if we have him, who are we?</i>

23:09.200 --> 23:15.290
<i>ball hitotsu ni kiri-kiri mai sa</i>

23:09.200 --> 23:15.290
<i>The ball spins round and round</i>

23:15.290 --> 23:21.330
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:21.330 --> 23:25.800
<i>itsuka kimeru ze inazuma shoot</i>

23:21.330 --> 23:25.800
<i>One day, I'll score with a lightning shot!</i>

23:27.090 --> 23:33.430
<i>son toki ore ga super hero sa</i>

23:27.090 --> 23:33.430
<i>When that happens, I'll become a super hero!</i>

23:33.430 --> 23:39.480
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:39.480 --> 23:45.770
<i>moete seishun kakenukero</i>

23:39.480 --> 23:45.770
<i>This fierce youth is on the field!</i>

23:49.610 --> 23:59.250
COMING UP, EPISODE 42:
TSUBASA, THE PHOENIX
